  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Sector Cooperation Phase 1 project in Morocco- Statistics</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the Strategic Sector Cooperation project is to support efforts to improve the quality of official statistics in Morocco. This will contribute to the public debate by providing society with relevant and easily accessible statistics and support informed decision making.</narrative>
