     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="Improved environmental statistics"></target>
     <actual value="Efforts concentrated on System of
Environmental-Economic Accounting (SEEA), specifically focusing on water accounts.
Missions conducted to facilitate water mapping. 
A comprehensive transformation map, encompassing a roadmap and work plan, has been
developed to guide the establishment of water accounts for Morocco.
Efforts to continue in phase II"></actual>
